é dráhy v Česku a Železnice Slovenskej republiky na Slovensku","sensitive":false,"stateDay":null,"anniversary":null,"source":{"title":"31. prosinec","revisionUrl":"https://cs.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=31._prosinec&oldid=25994743","historyUrl":"https://cs.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=31._prosinec&action=history","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/deed.cs","fetchedAt":"2026-10-29T02:54:11+00:00"},"article":{"title":"Česká a Slovenská Federativní Republika","url":"https://cs.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%C4%8Cesk%C3%A1_a_Slovensk%C3%A1_Federativn%C3%AD_Republika&oldid=26130996"}},{"id":9344,"date":"12-31","year":1991,"yearLabel":"1991","section":"world","text":"Ve 24:00 hod. oficiálně zanikl Sovětský svaz; už v srpnu téhož roku se osamostatnily pobaltské republiky","sensitive":false,"stateDay":null,"anniversary":null,"source":{"title":"31. prosinec","revisionUrl":"https://cs.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=31._prosinec&oldid=25994743","historyUrl":"https://cs.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=31._prosinec&action=history","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/deed.cs","fetchedAt":"2026-10-29T02:54:11+00:00"},"article":{"title":"Pobaltí","url":"https://cs.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Pobalt%C3%AD&oldid=26271232"}},{"id":9343,"date":"12-31","year":1970,"yearLabel":"1970","section":"world","text":"Rozpadla se britská skupina The Beatles","sensitive":false,"stateDay":null,"anniversary":null,"source":{"title":"31. prosinec","revisionUrl":"https://cs.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=31._prosinec&oldid=25994743","historyUrl":"https://cs.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=31._prosinec&action=history","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/deed.cs","fetchedAt":"2026-10-29T02:54:11+00:00"},"article":{"title":"The Beatles","url":"https://cs.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=The_Beatles&oldid=26316666"}},{"id":9340,"date":"12-31","